# Figma personal access token, used by the figma-framelink MCP server.
# Create one at: figma.com -> Settings -> Security -> Personal access tokens
# Required scopes: "File content" (read).
#
# The variable must be exported into the shell that launches Claude Code --
# .mcp.json expands ${FIGMA_PAT} from the process environment and does NOT
# read this file on its own. See AGENTS.md for how to export it.
FIGMA_PAT=figd_your_token_here
